oulders toward screen left. End at 10 seconds with her still visible, turned partly away from the man. Do not complete an exit. Preserve the emotional progression from restrained hurt, through wiping away a tear, to a relieved smile and a quiet turn away.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [297], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "widgets_values": ["aaff1bedf96452968488f20738a21968643107efa8eb43fea4ee5fae9c2c0bfa.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "LoadImage (Picture 1 — pilot)", "mode": 0, "size": [400, 480], "pos": [-1058.7072878412644, 6000.427946273376], "id": 149, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 8, "widgets_values_named": {"image": "aaff1bedf96452968488f20738a21968643107efa8eb43fea4ee5fae9c2c0bfa.png", "upload": "image"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "size": [1152.6380413303905, 1003.6635230496408], "pos": [705.6107765759155, 4879.042264559123], "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "AnimateDiff", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 19, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"metadata": {"duration": 10.125, "kind": "video", "frame_count": 243, "width": 1664, "fps": 24, "height": 928}, "storageProvider": "tos", "cos_url": "https://rh-comfyui01.tos-cn-beijing.volces.com/445aa9a89d7fa5567450f91c998092da/output/AnimateDiff_00001_p80-audio_jncpa_1793844385.mp